  "content": "🐧 Support Proton Environment\n\nYes, I am done implementing the transparent background support for Linux. Now, I have started adding a specific background for it.\n\nAs most game players are using Proton 10 as their compatibility layer, the code may detect the platform as Windows 🪟. However, Proton exposes a wine\\_get\\_version function to retrieve the Proton version. This function is only callable within a Proton environment.\n\nTherefore, we can use the following script to manage the background:\n\n🎨 For the background asset, I used the Free Sky with Clouds Background Pixel Art Set.\n\n📸 Result\n\nIn Linux, run the following command to test the result.\n\nResult",
